  maxHealth: 340
  contactDamage: 1
  scoreReward: 4000
  description: Breaks holy things for a living and kept the best head as a club.
    The embers leaking from the cracks are the last cathedral's opinion.
  tactics: 'An 80-point bone ward AND rifts - it casts the whole time you grind the
    blue bar, so the ward is not a free damage phase. Post-break the Desecration
    begins at full health: dense rift rings and rotating storm crosses. Budget your
    Purge for the second half.'
  displayName: The Iconoclast
